  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>min</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo></math>, so<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now solving the integral we get,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now in first integral, let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
